, `mcp__todo__add_task`, `mcp__todo__complete_task`, `mcp__todo__delete_task`.\n\nI need to use tool_search first to review the schemas, then invoke via tool_call.\n\nAlso the excel MCP tools: `mcp__excel__*`. I need to check schemas for those too — e.g., `describe_workbook`, `write_range`, `create_sheet`, `create_workbook`, `format_range`, `read_range`.\n\nLet me start by searching for the todo and excel tools.\n\nPlan:\n1. tool_search for todo tools and excel tools\n2. Call list_tasks\n3. Compute report\n4. Create workbook via excel MCP (create_workbook), write sheets, formulas\n5. Verify by reading back\n\nThe report date: today is 2026-11-10.\n\nLet me first search for the tool schemas.\n\nNote the instruction: \"Считай задачу просроченной только если она открыта и её срок раньше даты отчёта\" — a task is overdue only if open and deadline \u003c report date.\n\nAlso \"задач без срока\" — tasks without a deadline (open tasks without deadline? or all tasks without deadline? Probably tasks without deadline overall).\n\nLet me get the data first.\n\nSteps:\n1. tool_search \"select:mcp__todo__list_tasks\" and excel tools schemas.\n2. Call list_tasks.\n3. Then create the workbook.\n\nLet me do the tool searches in parallel: one for todo list, one for excel create/describe/read/write.\n\nActually tool_search takes a query. Let me do:\n- \"select:mcp__todo__list_tasks,mcp__todo__add_task\"\n- \"select:mcp__excel__create_workbook,mcp__excel__write_range,mcp__excel__read_range,mcp__excel__describe_workbook,mcp__excel__create_sheet,mcp__excel__format_range,mcp__excel__set_table\"\n\nWait — does the excel MCP server have create_workbook? Yes: \"mcp__excel__create_workbook\": \"Create a new, empty Excel workbook.\"\n\nThe excel MCP server is configured with the directory [home]/projects/dz/aidd_week_04_mcp/practice/agent. So file paths relative to it, e.g. 'todo_report_no_skill_2.xlsx'.\n\nLet me begin. I'll state what I'm about to do first.\n\nFirst message: brief statement, then tool_search calls in parallel.\n","streaming":false,"collapsed":true},{"id":"block-2","kind":"assistant","clientReceivedAt":0,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"text":"\n\nСначала посмотрю схемы доступных MCP-инструментов TODO и Excel, затем получу список задач.\n\n\n","streaming":false,"usage":{"inputTokens":16408,"outputTokens":928,"cachedTokens":0}},{"id":"block-3","kind":"tool","clientReceivedAt":0,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"toolCallId":"tool-call-4","title":"tool_search","status":"completed","preview":{"kind":"search","query":"select:mcp__todo__list_tasks,mcp__todo__add_task,mcp__todo__complete_task,mcp__todo__delete_task"},"resultPreview":{"kind":"text","text":"\u003cfunctions\u003e\n\u003cfunction\u003e{\"name\":\"mcp__todo__list_tasks\",\"description\":\"Возвращает полный список задач.\\n\\ndone: true — только выполненные, false — только невыполненные, не задано — все.\\n\",\"parametersJsonSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"done\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"boolean\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"default\":null,\"title\":\"Done\"}},\"title\":\"list_tasksArguments\"},\"serverName\":\"todo\"}\u003c/function\u003e\n\u003cfunction\u003e{\"name\":\"mcp__todo__add_task\",\"description\":\"Добавляет задачу в TODO. Пробелы по краям названия удаляются,\\nпустое название запрещено, максимум 200 символов.\\n\\npriority: low, normal или high. due: срок в формате YYYY-MM-DD (необязательно).\\nВозвращает созданную задачу с её id.\\n\",\"parametersJsonSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"title\":\"Title\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"priority\":{\"default\":\"normal\",\"title\":\"Priority\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"due\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"default\":null,\"title\":\"Due\"}},\"required\":[\"title\"],\"title\":\"add_taskArguments\"},\"serverName\":\"todo\"}\u003c/function\u003e\n\u003cfunction\u003e{\"name\":\"mcp__todo__complete_task\",\"description\":\"Отмечает задачу выполненной. Повторный вызов для уже выполненно